              },
              {
                "en_us": "You can see how many nearby people are looking at you.",
                "zh_cn": "可以看到周围有多少人看向自己。",
                "zh_tw": "可以看到周圍有多少人看向自己。"
              },
              {
                "en_us": "Each person looking at you grants 10 coin, up to 150 coin.",
                "zh_cn": "每个看到Ta的人会让Ta加10金币，最多150金币",
                "zh_tw": "每個看到Ta的人會讓Ta加10金幣，最多150金幣"
              },
              {
                "en_us": "Players with your normal autograph can continuously see your position.",
